            "review_title": "Review at Bánh căn bánh xèo",
            "review_text": "Sunshine31675847417\n1 contribution\n0\nBanh Can & Uncle & Sister & My Family\nMay 2024 • Family\nKnowing about the shop through GG search, I didn't expect much but it was a really great experience. Stepping into the table, the thing that surprised me the most was the demeanor of the tall, tall old man in the shop. Just through a few movements, his demeanor was impressive (you immediately knew it was not the demeanor of a Vietnamese person). Through a small conversation, we learned that he had gone to France before the revolution, so he spoke French as his mother tongue. Because our family chatted so loudly, the shop employee took the initiative to sit down and share more about her family, and because there were many similarities between her brother and her son, the two sides exchanged words. changed a lot (very fun). I was very impressed with the kindness and friendliness of the restaurant's staff. The food for me is 10/10, reasonable price, very suitable for my taste. Clean space, friendly staff, quality food, there's nothing more than the phrase \"armpit pain\" kakaka. Hopefully next time you come back, the shop will develop even more. Wishing the shop a prosperous business.💯❤️‍🔥💘\np/s: When I returned, the lady above also sent her brother a huge mango hahaha🥭🤣💕\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten May 27, 2024",
