            "review_title": "Review at Bánh căn bánh xèo",
            "review_text": "Bernard V\n6 contributions\n0\nTaste excellent Bánh cănh and bánh xeo, where French is spoken.\nAug 2023 • Couples\nThis is a new establishment opened in Nha Trang in Snack Style where you will find excellent banh can and banh xeo. In fact, that's all there is to it, so we'll only come to enjoy ourselves, because the products are so fresh, made on site after your order by the owner in the kitchen. The place and service are clean. You will quickly feel at home, the sheet metal worker speaks French like you and me but also English, which is very practical.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten September 7, 2023",
